  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Seeed Studio XIAO RP2350, edge castellations only (14 pads), so the module can be hand-soldered. The module's 16 underside pads (D11-D18, SWD, EN, BOOT, 3V3, VBAT, GND) are not used: under each of them sits an unconnected, mask-covered copper island (pads B15-B30, positions from Seeed's XIAO-RP2350-SMD footprint turned by 90 degrees) that keeps tracks and vias of other nets away.")
